*> PURPOSE : LOAN LIMITS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-09-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-11-07 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 507
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB LONNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0021.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY LON0021C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==AC==.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> MORTGAGE INSURANCE REQUIRED
    05 MORT-INS-IND       PIC X VALUE 'N'.
        88 MORT-REQUIRED VALUE 'Y'.
    05 RATE-ADJ           PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM 3000-LTV-RULES
    DISPLAY "MORT-INS-IND=" MORT-INS-IND
    DISPLAY "RATE-ADJ=" RATE-ADJ
    STOP RUN.
3000-LTV-RULES.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 1996
    *>  IF AC-LOAN-TO-VALUE > 68
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    *> MORTGAGE INSURANCE REQUIREMENT - LIMIT 127 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF AC-LOAN-TO-VALUE > 85
        SET MORT-REQUIRED TO TRUE
        MOVE 0.0050 TO RATE-ADJ
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO MORT-INS-IND
    END-IF.
